\nso this was never about farming traders. these launches use a 0.25% trading fee. by design, 100% of sell-side fees and 60% of buy-side fees go back into liquidity. the remaining 40% of buy-side fees goes to the creator.\\n\\nin other words, uniswap designed this system to keep growing liquidity, not to extract as much as possible from users.\\n\\nso why did i launch unibow?\\n\\nfor fun.\\n\\nusing a product before it has a public interface, and writing a few lines of code to make it work, is still very fun to me.\\n\\nthen around four people asked what my plans were for unibow. so i decided to turn it into a small launchpad before https://t.co/ioLKy72uA1 goes live.\\n\\nyes, i am trying to frontrun the uniswap interface. just for fun.\\n\\ni will not make money from the launchpad. i will not take a cut from anyone’s creator fees. everything will work the way uniswap designed it.\\n\\nthe only requirement is holding 500,000 $ubow.\\n\\nany wallet holding that amount will be able to add a name, symbol, description and image, then launch a token through the same uniswap path without even paying the gas fee. the wallet that launches the token will receive its creator fees.\\n\\ni would also love to hand the whole project over to a strong CTO team. i am happy to transfer the creator fees generated by $ubow to that team too.\\n\\nif you are that team, please dm me. i would love to give this weird little experiment a good home.", "url": "https://x.com/panik_eth/status/2084446054573871176", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2084441230411190369", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "Cloroshi", "text": "Another robinhood $cheems ATH", "url": "https://x.com/Cloroshi/status/2084441230411190369", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2084438757625762075", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "0xtrabeze", "text": "What the hell happened to the RH trenches? Just a few weeks ago, it seemed like everybody and their mother bridged over to catch the hype. Now? It seems like everyone is either waiting for the https://t.co/WpvsAYtc32 or ponsv2 launch just to keep jeeting. Revive the trenches atp.", "url": "https://x.com/0xtrabeze/status/2084438757625762075", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2084436469515760095", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "jscrypto4882", "text": "Holy candles!\\n\\nIt's like people finally realizing which doggo was destined to be the main PVE runner of Robinhood Chain all along.\\n\\n$cheems https://t.co/Qqz30MiDq7", "url": "https://x.com/jscrypto4882/status/2084436469515760095", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2084429307045167564", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "timthedrummer", "text": "@PatronReRenaiss Is this Robin Hood chain? Or Solana?", "url": "https://x.com/timthedrummer/status/2084429307045167564", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2084427982932791746", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "trenchdiver", "text": "This note is false. https://t.co/N78pwUz3z8 was linked directly from Uniswap’s website as its upcoming token launchpad.\\n\\nListLaunches is an endpoint for the launchpad’s not-yet-public API, so it would not be expected to appear in Uniswap’s existing developer documentation. Comparing it to the general pool-data API or ETH/USDC rankings is therefore irrelevant.", "url": "https://x.com/trenchdiver/status/2084427982932791746", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2084425074187128881", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "0FJAKE", "text": "$HOODIE will be the bridge for retail.\\n\\nRobinhood App → Robinhood Chain", "url": "https://x.com/0FJAKE/status/2084425074187128881", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2084424980213662208", "q": "robinhood chain uniswap", "author": "UFOvnis11", "text": "������ New launch on PenkPad!\\nPEPE BURN HOOD ($PEPEBURN20)\\n⛓ Chain: Robinhood Chain\\n������ Supply: 1B