://x.com/prelumni/status/2084344120441495614", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2084329270357471233", "q": "$CHWDR", "author": "CryptoMrLi888", "text": "$FRONG 目前5.7M 这个势头是要往10m+ 冲锋\\n\\n0x6245e67affa44a23077f0ea7f981a8dc743a0c47\\n\\n以下是周边：\\n\\n$CHWDR (同一个dev) 目前430K\\n0xb358766827d7c704d3c52a57b5cf181d1b0ffc6c\\n\\n$TOYODA 目前 87K 这个比 $FRONG 出来的还要早\\n0xe9d9518fb64d571f4670f8307d9c502eb524dd40\\n\\n$POOLS 目前56K 推上说这是台子第一个币 (https://t.co/pvNtkUdhrl)\\n0x385b36ff682ab4c76e7c37a66b96aabc466471d5\\n\\n$CASH (frong dev买过的代币)目前45K\\n0xca651c0100ddccc8c55935b53584cf1ef21e8c33", "url": "https://x.com/CryptoMrLi888/status/2084329270357471233", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2084304099223244825", "q": "$CHWDR", "author": "lunchmilks", "text": "People starting to discover $CHWDR should I cop more now?", "url": "https://x.com/lunchmilks/status/2084304099223244825", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2084303413073109122", "q": "zacklabadie", "author": "Showy005", "text": "@tiger_web3 @zacklabadie @0xSLK 谢谢疼爱！", "url": "https://x.com/Showy005/status/2084303413073109122", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2084301522385392125", "q": "$CHWDR", "author": "ProMint_X", "text": "Uniswap launchpad on Robinhood today?\\n\\n@zacklabadie (Uniswap product designer) launched $CHWDR.\\n\\nUniswap launchpad is already visible on the frontend.\\n\\n@NeoCallss claims we’re getting alpha today on the Robinhood chain.\\n\\nIs the launch really happening today?\\n\\nAre you guys ready for the Robinhood trenches to come alive?", "url": "https://x.com/ProMint_X/status/2084301522385392125", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2084301496716275889", "q": "zacklabadie", "author": "tiger_web3", "text": "@Showy005 @zacklabadie @0xSLK 问就是你说的对", "url": "https://x.com/tiger_web3/status/2084301496716275889", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2084301105299587447"