badie", "author": "Showy005", "text": "你们可以这样理解 $LEAK 的叙事：\\n\\n这个新的发射路径目前只发了三个币。\\n\\n龙一现在大概 5M，其中前两个都是同一个钱包部署的，而 $LEAK 是唯一由独立开发者部署的代币。\\n\\n前面两个代币是Uniswap 产品设计负责人 @zacklabadie 亲自发布。\\n\\n而第三个，是 @0xSLK 一名技术极客实名发布。\\n\\n所以它有特别的意义。", "url": "https://x.com/Showy005/status/2084276288920146120", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2084270948682027060", "q": "$CHWDR", "author": "esteehkid", "text": "@0xbnkrupt only $frong launched by zack\\n\\n$chwdr launched by this wallet 0x3ace8ca50c299649b888b26474cc723e90712d39\\nthat wallet just started trading on bsc recently. i dont think it belong to to zack or uniswap teaam https://t.co/rDudRSacEj", "url": "https://x.com/esteehkid/status/2084270948682027060", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2084270856981864621", "q": "$CHWDR", "author": "hiepsimuvnn", "text": "yo\\n\\n$CHWDR claim page working rn\\n\\ngot mine first try\\n\\nhow long it stays open ?\\n\\nhttps://t.co/yYmrkDVHr4", "url": "https://x.com/hiepsimuvnn/status/2084270856981864621", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2084268377145770200", "q": "zacklabadie", "author": "froggaplz", "text": "@GifferOG @0xSLK The X link on the Uniswap frong chart takes you to @zacklabadie ‘s account… 🤔", "url": "https://x.com/froggaplz/status/2084268377145770200", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2084255745298587716", "q": "$CHWDR", "author": "BitStern", "text": "$CHWDR ChowdLaunchpad history", "url": "https://x.com/BitStern/status/2084255745298587716", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2084243951314407608", "q": "$CHWDR", "author": "stflyer1", "text": "目前meme买了下面几个：\\nBSC:\\n$币有(alpha预期)\\n$jacket(何姐互动)\\n\\nHood:\\n$CHWDR(疑似uni团队部署的launchpad）\\n\\nEth:\\n$sato(hook v4 og)\\n如果一个都不翻倍那我也没招了\\n只能自己安慰可能还在憋个大的￼￼￼￼￼￼������", "url": "https://x.com/stflyer1/status/2084243951314407608", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2084243200768684074", "q": "