412982579753392", "q": "zacklabadie", "author": "dckazi", "text": "At this stage I’m convinced https://t.co/KTiMEKFWV1 is going live in the coming week(s). No mention of @zacklabadie’s $frong launch from him or anyone on the @Uniswap team other than @haydenzadams “🐸” response to someone asking what pools was. A half million in unclaimed creator fees.\\n\\nSome trench knowledge for the newbies..even though the time rug is happening in real time, smart money accumulates, while impatient dopamine craving degens will get bored and move on if they already haven’t. Don’t let a pullback discourage you. The good news is they’ll be fomoing back in once the vale is lifted. \\n\\nWe comfy 🦄", "url": "https://x.com/dckazi/status/2083412982579753392", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2083377796811002245", "q": "zacklabadie", "author": "farmerspig", "text": "@zacklabadie when CTO $frong ?", "url": "https://x.com/farmerspig/status/2083377796811002245", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2083356424931795360", "q": "zacklabadie", "author": "machines1537", "text": "@biiiiymeister @zacklabadie my funds are stuck on the Arc network. How can I bridge them back to RH?", "url": "https://x.com/machines1537/status/2083356424931795360", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2083325972519272549", "q": "zacklabadie", "author": "dino_kun1n9", "text": "@biiiiymeister @zacklabadie This thesis so bullish", "url": "https://x.com/dino_kun1n9/status/2083325972519272549", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2083321314694336925", "q": "zacklabadie", "author": "GerryHuang2", "text": "@biiiiymeister @zacklabadie Pin in the x com", "url": "https://x.com/GerryHuang2/status/2083321314694336925", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2083319999293280294", "q": "zacklabadie", "author": "guccigff", "text": "@biiiiymeister @zacklabadie That's why we will be different", "url": "https://x.com/guccigff/status/2083319999293280294", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2083306079971066259", "q": "$CHWDR", "author": "0xGutsTrades", "text": ". @Uniswap may be building a launchpad on Robinhood Chain.\\n\\nI dug into https://t.co/o9tyb55CxP: live contracts, launch models, FRONG/CHWDR, and early token narratives. https://t.co/lAm3OF5HYo", "url": "https://x.com/0xGutsTrades/status/2083306079971066259", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2083293091964796984", "q": "zacklabadie", "author": "raidmach1ne", "text": "@saintniko @zacklabadie @haydenzadams \\n\\nhe thinks frong is lame\\n\\nprove him he is wrong ������", "url": "https://x.com/raidmach1ne/status/2083293091964796984", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2083286880800391426", "q": "zacklabadie", "author": "_WhiteRay_", "text": "video from https://t.co/bQtafg5Jer is served from CloudFront https://t.co/bK33LzLdg6… and its S3 object metadata contains `x-amz-meta-uploaded by: zack.labadie@uniswap.org\\n\\nMeans $fronge was obviously launched by @zacklabadie \\n\\n0x6245e67affA44a23077f0Ea7f981a8DC743a0c47\\n\\nHave", "url": "https://x.com/_WhiteRay_/status/2083286880800391426", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2083190974507843666", "q": "$CHWDR", "author": "0xSLK", "text": ". @Uniswap may be building a launchpad on Robinhood Chain.\\n\\nI dug into https://t.co/o9tyb55CxP: live contracts, launch models, FRONG/CHWDR, and early token narratives. https://t.co/lAm3OF5HYo", "url": "https://x.com/0xSLK/status/2083190974507843666", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2083171184246403500", "q": "zacklabadie", "author": "GainzRH", "text": "Gainz caught $FRONG a coin launched by uniswap team @zacklabadie \\n\\n$FRONG +7.3%\\n+$79.09 profit. Zero charts watched.\\n\\nThis is Conservative mode  \\nThis is GAINZ. https://t.co/vdPrrCcg7m", "url": "https://x.com/GainzRH/status/2083171184246403500", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2083086871739986431", "q": "zacklabadie", "author": "raidmach1ne", "text": "I strongly believe $frong was launched by @zacklabadie. I also think there's a good chance it was coordinated with the Uniswap team, and possibly even @haydenzadams. His response of a frog emoji probably proves it.\\n\\nThe frog video on https://t.co/hapkAO9Edd was uploaded by someone using the email zack.labadie@uniswap.org and just a few hours later a $frong token launched whose deployer wallet had previously received funds from Zack's wallet.\\n\\nThere are simply too many coincidences.\\n\\n@Uniswap's team isn't naive. They understand that nowadays trenchers are a massive force in defi lol.\\n\\nMaybe $frong is Uniswap's way of onboarding the trenches and winning the launchpad war on Robinhood chain. Let's see what they are cookin ������", "url": "https://x.com/raidmach1ne/status/2083086871739986431", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2083080514043322826", "q": "$CHWDR", "author": "maxuelulu1", "text": "uniswap 要推出一个新产品\\nlaunches栏点击soon会进入 https://t.co/yV3sBtbHdw 有只青蛙网页\\n凌晨4点UNI的产品设计师地址发了个币 $FRONG 当前300多万市值，隔4小时又发了一个 $CHWDR 这个20多万市值。\\n发币地址是：0xe19537029b8013dc37c55d509b0a5038c7c5ce58\\n地址资金来源于Base First Funder @zacklabadie labadie.eth：0x1db6aD3344F1Ae0A495b28B031B80cDDd99f2FD0\\n发币地址和资金来源地址还都曾买过数个代币，市值都比较低都买了一些等发酵当作彩票。", "url": "https://x.com/maxuelulu1/status/2083080514043322826", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2083075876703359109", "q": "$CHWDR", "author": "chupitowisk", "text": "⚡️ $CHWDR ChowdLaunch is picking up fresh liquidity.\\n$hood\\n\\n@RobinhoodApp chain\\n\\nCA: 0xb358766827d7c704d3c52a57b5cf181d1b0ffc6c\\n\\n������ Vote rn and grab behind the listing\\nhttps://t.co/8RSTbGmsJm", "url": "https://x.com/chupitowisk/status/2083075876703359109", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2083046277411897544", "q": "zacklabadie", "author": "Opifor", "text": "Correction to my previous post: I got one important part wrong.\\n\\n    I said I had found no direct transfers between Zack Labadie’s verified wallets and the wallet that launched $FRONG. That\\n    conclusion was incomplete. I had checked Ethereum and Robinhood Chain, but I had not included Base.\\n\\n    Once Base is included, the attribution picture changes significantly.\\n\\n    It is 100% proven onchain that the wallet which launched FRONG, 0xE195...cE58, had previously been directly funded by\\n    0x1db6...2FD0, a wallet cryptographically verified on Zack Labadie’s official Farcaster profile:\\n\\n    https://t.co/drsaUtRGbA\\n\\n    The actual FRONG launch caller was E195:\\n\\n    https://t.co/hMu03StUus\\n\\n    On November 26, 2024, Zack’s verified wallet sent 0.000601647451057836 ETH directly to E195. This was E195’s first normal\\n    transaction and first native funding on Base:\\n\\n    https://t.co/nyF37E6eTH\\n\\n    On January 7, 2025, the same wallet directly transferred four NFT/ERC-1155 assets to E195.\\n\\n    The following day, it sent another 0.005869440312463167 ETH:\\n\\n    https://t.co/7FbcmGRN99\\n\\n    On February 27, 2025, it also called transfer(E195, 205.795452805595001658) on the HIGHER token contract:\\n\\n    https://t.co/IeRxAPT1HF\\n\\n    These are not explorer labels, beneficiary settings, or identity fields supplied by the FRONG caller. They are direct outbound\\n    transactions initiated by Zack’s verified wallet between 518 and 610 days before FRONG launched.\\n\\n    That distinction changes everything.\\n\\n    A random third party could copy Zack’s public handle, wallet address, uploader metadata, and the frog asset after discovering\\n    the public https://t.co/nItIRFUSB1 site. The launcher accepts unverified identity metadata, and anyone can select a public wallet as fee\\n    beneficiary.\\n\\n    But a random third party cannot go back in time and create signed 2024 and 2025 transactions from Zack’s verified wallet to\\n    E195.\\n\\n    The rest of the factual evidence in my original post remains correct:\\n\\n    The frong.mp4 asset used by https://t.co/nItIRFUSB1 carries archived S3 metadata naming zack.labadie@uniswap.org as its uploader:\\n\\n    https://t.co/c6yjsDc2lz\\n\\n    E195 launched FRONG and selected the same Zack-linked wallet as its fee beneficiary.\\n\\n    E195 then used the same Uniswap launch infrastructure to test both an instant pool through FRONG and an LBP/CCA launch through\\n    CHWDR.\\n\\n    The exact ETH used immediately before FRONG was bridged by E195 from its own Ethereum address, so the historical Base\\n    transfers were not the final FRONG gas transfer. But they prove something more important for attribution: E195 already had a\\n    direct, repeated and long-standing operational relationship with Zack’s verified wallet.\\n\\n    This makes the “completely unrelated third party copied public information” scenario much weaker than I previously thought.\\n\\n    My updated conclusion is that FRONG was very likely an internal Uniswap/pools.trade test launched from a team-linked wallet.\\n\\n    There is still no signed statement proving that Zack personally controlled E195’s private key. That final distinction matters\\n    if we are making a strict key-ownership claim.\\n\\n    But the historical funding and operational connection are no longer speculation. They are fully verifiable onchain.\\n\\n    The proof was not in the FRONG transaction alone. It was sitting in E195’s older Base history.", "url": "https://x.com/Opifor/status/2083046277411897544", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2083031878576083393", "q": "$CHWDR", "author": "lunchmilks", "text": "Hold Your $CHWDR \\n\\nAfter Verification On @fomo \\nWe’re riding rockets to the moon \\n🚀🚀🚀🚀🚀🚀🚀🚀🚀🚀🚀", "url": "https://x.com/lunchmilks/status/2083031878576083393", "media": [], "likes": 0, "rts": 0, "created": ""}, {"id": "2083021623926358398", "q": "$CHWDR", "author": "B